Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(南极洲 1904年10月10日)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《异形大战铁血战士》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(2004年10月3日 低地球轨道 韦兰德公司PS12人造卫星)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(内布拉斯加州 “银箔”卫星接收站)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(韦兰德工业 #6-D卫星跟踪与数据传送地面接收站)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(不明热源信号)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here. Take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,PS12送回的数据流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a data stream from PS12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卫星在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,14区正上方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right above sector 14.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.17,0:04:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,14区什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There isn't anything in sector 14.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(尼泊尔 罗拉冰瀑)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂? - 伍兹小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Miss Woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.93,0:04:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴能够联络到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pleasure to make your acquaintance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.65,0:04:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫麦克斯韦·斯塔福德 韦兰德工业的代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's Maxwell Stafford. I represent Weyland Industries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.81,0:04:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜看 他又要起诉我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. He's suing us again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你误会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You misunderstand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你愿意见见韦兰德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Weyland has offered to fund your foundation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会提供你们整年的支助基金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a year, if you'll meet with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候? 明天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When? Tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天可能有点问题 我回去要一个礼拜时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow's gonna be a problem.Take me a week to get back to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错 我曾向韦兰德先生提及这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I told Mr Weyland that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他等不了一个礼拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he didn't have a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(墨西哥 特奥蒂瓦坎城)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须进去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must be right on top of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.75,0:05:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么 塞巴斯提安?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, Sebastian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说 1950年代初期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Early 1950s, I'd say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我们都在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Juan, we're almost there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据你说的?给他们垂死国王的最后礼物?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to you, the Teotihuacans' final gift to their dying king...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一个百事可乐?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was a Pepsi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托 再给我一个月 - 不可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, give me one more month. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托了 - 我要换一组人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please. - I'm bringing another team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道 然而缺少人手和批准 我们也束手无策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without a crew and a permit we're out of business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 让小组等上两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the team together for two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去墨西哥城和银行谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go to Mexico City and I'll talk to the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要筹集更多的资金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get us more money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我能帮你达成心愿 教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might be able to help you accomplish that, Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.94,0:06:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I know you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换你一小会儿时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In exchange for a little of your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.81,0:06:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(南极洲 罗斯冰架)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(查尔斯·比绍普·韦兰德 现代机器人技术先驱)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该把闪光灯关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've switched the flash off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.48,0:07:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的杂志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's your magazine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉 - 不要紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - That's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把旅程拍回去给我的儿子看看 这就是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm documenting the trip for my boys. This is them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雅各布和斯科提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob and Scotty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你介意替我拍张照吗?谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind taking a picture? Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是想让他们看看 老爸并不总是那么烦人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wanna show them that their dad wasn't always so boring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 笑 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Smile. - OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you go. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫格瑞米·米勒 我是化学工程师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Graeme Miller.I'm a chemical engineer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾里莎·伍兹 环保科学技术员兼向导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alexa Woods, environmental technician and guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为韦兰德工作?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you work for Weyland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不…我的时间都用在小型环保工作组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I split my time between working for a small environmental group{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…以及带领科学家们在冰川上探险上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and taking scientists on expeditions on the ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾里莎 系好安全带 我们要撞上气流了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex. Buckle up. We're gonna hit some turbulence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.53,0:07:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.45,0:08:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是你朋友?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he a friend of yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸的朋友 这儿大多数飞行员都是我父亲培训出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of my dad's. He trained most of the pilots here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚通过PSR\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just passed the PSR.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 见鬼 我本应拍张照的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, damn. I wish I'd got a picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拍什么? - PSR\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of what? - The PSR.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们通过之前 他就应该提醒一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish he'd called it out before we passed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,PSR是指安全返回点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The PSR is the point of safe return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说我们耗尽了一半的燃料 便无法返回了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means we've used up half our fuel, so we can't turn back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错 但如果情况不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, but if something went wrong,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概我们能着陆的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we could land, presumably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们可以水上迫降 - 是的 水上迫降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We could ditch. - Yeah. Ditch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但在这种水温下我们活不过三分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the temperature of the water would kill us in three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.49,0:08:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(破冰船 风笛丸号  当前航向：机密)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 检查完毕 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Weyland's check cleared. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:09:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么?我们正准备去听听他到底要说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? We're gonna listen to whatever he has to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们点头 微笑 无论他出任何价我们都婉拒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We nod, we smile and we politely decline whatever offer he makes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着钱 我们调头回墨西哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the money and we'll head back to Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开心么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Havin' fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是呀 真是个棒极了的冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! This is quite an adventure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我的孩子们不会相信这个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, my kids are not gonna to believe this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你能拍个照么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but would you make a picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直按着等闪光灯亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to hold like that until it flashes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快下来 你把屁股当帽子戴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off! Or you'll be wearing your ass for a hat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright. OK. Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错的团队精神啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice team spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和“偷窥者”保持距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the beakers away from the gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说的“偷窥者”是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does he mean 'beaker'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是科学家 在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what they call scientists up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗? “挑选者”就像一场木偶戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know "beaker", like in the muppet show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.04,0:09:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎大家搭乘 请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody. Please, your attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,七天前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven days ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在南极洲上空的一颗搜寻矿床的卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of my satellites over Antarctica hunting for mineral deposits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.18,0:10:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现了一个突然的地下热量激增\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}discovered a sudden heat bloom beneath the earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轮廓大致如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which outlined this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红线代表固态墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The red lines indicate solid walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通过热导制图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through thermal mapping,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们生成了建筑物的三维影像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've generated a three-dimensional image of the structure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常宏伟 包含数百个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's massive, containing hundreds of rooms,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,环绕着中央核心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all built around a central core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的专家告诉我 这是座金字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My experts tell me it's a pyramid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.97,0:10:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们无法达成共识的是：是谁 在何时修建了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What they can't agree on is who built it and when.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一位专家告诉我 具有阿芝台克文化的遗留特征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One expert tells me this has features reminiscent of the Aztecs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一位却说很可能是柬埔寨风格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another tells me it's probably Cambodian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们达成共识的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What they all agree on is that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,平滑的侧面一定是埃及风格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the smooth side is definitively Egyptian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你的专家们说得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think your experts are right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哪一位? - 都说得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which one? - All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确切点 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meaning what, exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这座金字塔包含了这三种文化的特征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This pyramid contains the features of all three cultures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.96,0:11:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这或许是有史以来的第一座金字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This might be the first pyramid ever built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.94,0:11:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是由谁建造的呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But built by whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最初的文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the first civilisation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是谁能把金字塔建造在这儿呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how could anyone possibly build a pyramid out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.53,0:11:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,古代地图显示南极洲不曾为冰川覆盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ancient maps show Antarctica free of ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很可能这片大陆曾经适合居住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's likely the continent was once habitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.93,0:11:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法告诉你是谁建造了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you who built it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我能取样 便能知道它建造的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I could take a sample from it, I can tell you how old it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米勒博士 我答应送你过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr Miller, I'm offering to put you right next to this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃…是什么导致了热量激增呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What caused the heat bloom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这块冰川的确切地点在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where exactly on the ice is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布维岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bouvetoya Island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不在冰面上 在冰川下2000英尺处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not on the ice. It's 2,000ft below it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奎因先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Quinn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔福德先生 你眼前是世界上最好的钻探队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Stafford. You're looking at the best drilling team in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.55,0:12:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们七天就能到达那个深度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll chew to that depth in seven days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人在此训练的同时 三周内要达到熟练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Add three weeks on top of that to train everyone here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没那么多时间 伍兹小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have that kind of time, Ms Woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只是我拥有南极洲上空的卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the only one with a satellite over Antarctica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不久 其他人都会纷至沓来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Others will be here soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是我未表达清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I wasn't clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在此的所有人都还没准备好这次行程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one in this room is ready for this trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是我召集你们来这儿的原因所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I asked you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布维岛是个与世隔绝的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bouvetoya is one of the world's most isolated places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最近的陆地也在1000英里以外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nearest land is 1,000 miles away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是遇上麻烦 我们无法得到救援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no help if we run into trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得不错 那是片人迹罕至的土壤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. It's a no-man's-land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是情况紧急 箭已离弦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the train has left the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为我的讲话代表了船上所有人的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I think I speak for everyone aboard this ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冒险是值得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is worth the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另觅向导吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find another guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和韦兰德先生谈过了 钱已经划入了你的账户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spoken with Mr Weyland. Money's been wired to your account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直升机在补充燃料 准备送你回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chopper's refuelling to fly you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们找的谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who'd you get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.15,0:13:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰拉德·默多克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gerald Murdoch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,默多克只有两季的冰上作业经验 他尚未准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murdoch has two seasons of ice time. He's not ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保罗·伍德曼怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Paul Woodman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们和他通了电话 - 然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We called him. - And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他和你一样 说了堆“废话”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave the same bullshit answer you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“废话”?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Bullshit"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德先生 我给你讲的话怎么是废话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I told you in there wasn't bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你匆忙行事 有人会受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you rush this, people will get hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许还会出人命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白你 我们又不是叫你带我们上珠穆朗玛峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. We're not asking you to take us up Everest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:13:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需要下船后 你带我们去金字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you to take us from the ship to the pyramid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后回来 仅此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and back. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到了金字塔里面 又怎么办呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about inside the pyramid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这点不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一旦抵达那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we're on the site,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会用钱买来最好的技术和专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have the best technology and experts that money can buy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是新的吗? - 是最新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this new? - It's the latest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德先生 要是我领队 我就绝不会离开我的队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Weyland, when I lead my team I don't ever leave my team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很欣赏你的热情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I admire your passion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你和我们同行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you were going with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你犯了个大错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're making a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是高层大气产生的现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in the upper atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来自太阳的质子流和电子流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Streams of protons and electrons from the sun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被地球的磁场偏折 产生了太阳辐射风暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being deflected by the earth's magnetic field, causing a solar radiation storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沙尔克顿称南极洲为“人类的终极旅程”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shackleton called Antarctica "the last great journey left to man".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是世界上唯一一块无人知晓的地域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the one place left in the world that no one owns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿能获得完全的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's completely free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.94,0:15:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有点偏爱企鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sort of partial to the penguins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能在仔细考虑一下与我们同行 艾里莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you'd reconsider coming with us, Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 别又让我拿出我孩子们的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, don't make me pull out pictures of my kids again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你孩子可没那么可爱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your kids aren't that cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去看看别人孩子的照片怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we got pictures of other people's kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想听我的忠告吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want my advice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.43,0:15:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呆在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来问问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们和你呆在一起生还的机会大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we stand a better chance of surviving with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是和那个二流向导呆一起生还的机会大?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or with the number-two choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伍兹小姐 你的直升机补充好燃料了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Woods, your helicopter's refuelled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们等着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, listen up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gather round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你她会留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you she'd stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她无法抵挡我的生物磁性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can't resist my animal magnetism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笑吧 米勒 笑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laugh it up, Miller. Laugh it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确保你们在这次旅程中生还是我的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my job to keep you alive on this expedition,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并且需要你们的协助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I need your help to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我没有时间让你们得到充分训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since I don't have time to properly train you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我定下三条规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm laying down three rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.53,0:17:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一 谁都不能单独去任何地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One. No one goes anywhere alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝不允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都必须随时保持联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone must maintain constant communication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意外将会随时发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unexpected things are gonna happen. When they do ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦发生 谁也不要争当英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no one tries to be a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 明白 小姐 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, ma'am. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.03,0:17:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经历了七季的冰上作业 我都没见到枪能挽救人的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven seasons on the ice and I've never seen a gun save someone's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我并不打算用它 - 那为什么还带呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't plan on using it. - Then why bring it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.87,0:17:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这和常备避孕套的原理一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same principle as a condom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.25,0:17:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我宁可带着不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather have one and not need it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不愿需要时发现没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than need it and not have one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.63,0:18:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你决定留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad that you decided to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把卡车拖到冰上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move the trucks out on the ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么戴个瓶盖?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with the bottle cap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么要戴个瓶盖?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with the bottle cap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是颇有价值的考古发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a valuable archaeological find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是个小孩 在意大利的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a kid growing up in Italy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.67,0:18:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这么大的月亮被称为什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know what they call a moon that big?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罐闷月神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}La luna del cacciatore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罐闷月神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}La luna del cacciatore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brava.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.45,0:18:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:18:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎月（收获月后的第一次满月）\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hunter's moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hunter's moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别熄火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep those engines running!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再让让 康纳斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move over a little further. Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是座废弃的捕鲸站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an abandoned whaling station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 调上来 快点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, bring it up. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.99,0:19:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据你的卫星图像 金字塔就位于正下方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to your satellite imagery, the pyramid is located directly beneath it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 调上来 快点…展开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, bring it up. Come on. Spread out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将在这儿扎营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll use this place as a base camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奎因先生 尽快开始钻探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Quinn, begin drilling operations as soon as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就去部署\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 伙计们 开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, guys, let's move out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.53,0:21:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲸的骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whale bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个工作站1904被遗弃的 一夜之间所有人都失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This station was abandoned in 1904.Everyone just disappeared overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自那以来一直是个谜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a big mystery back then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为《国家地理》杂志来一张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One for National Geographic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾里莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.70,0:23:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都不得单独行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one goes anywhere alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.84,0:23:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那儿有东西 听 听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something there. Listen. Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当心点 会咬人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful. They bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.81,0:23:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 过来 过来 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Over here. Over here. - What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完美地按照30度角钻的洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's drilled at a perfect 30-degree angle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.23,0:23:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有多深?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far does it go down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.06,0:23:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直抵达金字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the way to the pyramid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.71,0:23:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这个 一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is. Clear as day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.78,0:23:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天的同一时刻…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the same time yesterday...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.87,0:24:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.98,0:24:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么挖成的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was it done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,某种热力设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thermal equipment of some kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.78,0:24:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你的那种?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更加先进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More advanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,强劲得难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredibly powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.01,0:24:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从未见过这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen anything like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.59,0:24:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你吧 世界上没有哪个工作组有这种机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no team and no machine in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.47,0:24:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,24小时内能钻到这个深度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that could cut to this depth in 24 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.30,0:24:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们要探明此事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the only way we're gonna know for sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.66,0:24:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一途径就是下去看个究竟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to get down there and find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看那个 去换了 就现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that. Change it. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.49,0:24:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 伙计们 怎么这么久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, guys, what's taking so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.24,0:24:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴就要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a storm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.24,0:25:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探险队可不容生病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no room for sick men on this expedition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.45,0:25:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医生告诉我 最糟糕的情况已经过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My doctors tell me the worst is behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.43,0:25:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不太会撒谎啊 韦兰德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a very good liar, Mr Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.55,0:25:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留在船上吧 我们每个小时都向你汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on the ship. We'll update you at the top of every hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.47,0:25:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生病的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you get sick,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.39,0:25:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会回想你的人生 以及如何被后人评价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you think about your life and how you're gonna be remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.22,0:25:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我死了会怎样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what will happen when I go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.25,0:25:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,股价会下挫十个百分点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten per cent fall in share prices. Maybe twelve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.89,0:25:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是12个 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.51,0:25:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾听过这种说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard this speech before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.71,0:25:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我老爸在离瑞尼火山峰700英尺处跌断了腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad broke his leg 700ft from the summit of Mount Rainier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.40,0:25:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很像你 他不肯回头 也不听我们的劝阻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was like you.He wouldn't go back or let us stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.46,0:25:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们抵达了山顶 他启开了一瓶香槟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We reached the top, and he opened a bottle of champagne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.59,0:25:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我第一次喝酒 在14000英尺的地方和老爸一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had my first drink with my dad at 14,400ft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.18,0:25:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下山途中 他腿上的血块进入了内脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the way down, he developed a blood clot in his leg that travelled to his lung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.80,0:26:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他忍受了四个小时的痛苦 在离基地仅有20分钟路程的地方去世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He suffered for four hours before dying 20 minutes from the base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.60,0:26:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为那是你老爸记得的最后的东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think that's the last thing your dad remembers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.26,0:26:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那种痛苦呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是和女儿一起在14000的海拔喝香槟呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or drinking champagne with his daughter 14,000ft in the air?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.16,0:26:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.84,0:27:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.01,0:27:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Weyland!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.90,0:27:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人滑下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.22,0:27:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.97,0:27:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.68,0:27:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行动 就现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.10,0:29:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不太明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.94,0:29:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.61,0:29:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及其他工作队的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of another team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.79,0:29:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 那条隧道不可能自然生成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that tunnel didn't dig itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.58,0:29:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.74,0:29:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,康纳斯 打开那盏灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connors, get those lights up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.62,0:29:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.87,0:30:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜 韦兰德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, Mr Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像你会名垂青史了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you'll be leaving your mark after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.47,0:30:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.10,0:30:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.44,0:30:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为此我要感谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you all for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.33,0:30:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们创造历史吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.54,0:32:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.71,0:32:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.02,0:32:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识这是埃及人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I recognise the Egyptian...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.62,0:32:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二个符号是阿芝台克人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The second symbol is Aztec.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.73,0:32:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英国被征服前的时代的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pre-conquest era.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.43,0:33:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第三个是柬埔寨的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The third is Cambodian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.44,0:33:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.78,0:33:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金字塔包含了三种文化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pyramid contains all three cultures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.26,0:33:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和它的外形一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what it looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.46,0:33:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"你可以选择进入"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You may......choose......to enter."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.98,0:33:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“选中的人可以进入”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Those who choose may enter."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.97,0:33:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁教你翻译的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who taught you to translate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有趣 好像就是你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny. Kinda looked like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.78,0:33:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 不是“选中”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not "choose".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.16,0:33:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是“被选中的”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's "chosen".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.49,0:33:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“只有被选中的人能进入”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Only the chosen ones may enter."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.29,0:33:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奎因 是你在那儿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quinn, is that you out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.38,0:34:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米其尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikkel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.11,0:36:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是些什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.95,0:36:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是牺牲者的墓室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the sacrificial chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.43,0:36:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能都是阿芝台克人和埃及人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the Aztecs and the Egyptians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.98,0:36:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,建造这座金字塔的人都信仰宗教献祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever built this pyramid believed in ritual sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.08,0:36:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是被选中的人为上帝献祭的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where the chosen ones were offered to the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.55,0:36:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些被选中的人就躺在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those that were chosen would lie here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.29,0:37:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没有以任何形式被捆绑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't bound or tied in any way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.37,0:37:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是自愿死亡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They went to die willingly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.91,0:37:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男人和女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men and women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.92,0:37:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这被看作一种荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was considered an honour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.74,0:37:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.61,0:37:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.36,0:37:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.81,0:37:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整个头骨和脊柱被整块切下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire skull and spinal column were removed in one piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.30,0:37:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.35,0:37:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里 平整光滑的切痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at them. The cleanness of the cut. Straight through the bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.98,0:37:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何磨损 什么也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no abrasions, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.78,0:37:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能只是风吹过这地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's probably just the wind, moving through the tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.54,0:37:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.39,0:38:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管它是什么 已经死了很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever this is, it's been dead awhile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.62,0:38:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骨头已经完全钙化了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bones have completely calcified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.03,0:38:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全不知道它已经有多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No idea how long it's been here but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.56,0:38:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这里气温使它保存了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the temperature has kept it preserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.74,0:38:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它看起来像某种蝎子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like some kind of scorpion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.89,0:38:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对 这里的气候对蝎子非常不利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, climate is too hostile for a scorpion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.41,0:38:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你见过像这个的东西么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen anything like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.37,0:39:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"他们献出生命 猎杀得以开始"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"They gave their lives so the hunt could begin."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.05,0:39:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿是怎么回事儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.30,0:39:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,献祭中取走献身者的心脏的情况 是很普遍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's common in ritual sacrifice to take the heart of the victim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.01,0:39:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.23,0:39:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那却不是心脏长的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not where your heart is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.19,0:39:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此外 看起来好像骨头被硬生生弯折了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, it looks like the bones were bent straight out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.52,0:39:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有东西从身体里钻了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something broke out of this body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.53,0:40:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你发现了什么 马克思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you found, Max?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.76,0:40:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个通向另一层的通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shaft to another level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.46,0:40:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像下面还有另外的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like there's another room down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.02,0:41:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去下面的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move to that lower room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.28,0:41:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're moving on, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.84,0:41:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伍兹小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms Woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.40,0:41:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你 留在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.26,0:41:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卢梭 你和他一道 带领一队人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here. Rousseau, you stay with him. Keep a team with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.50,0:41:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,清点一下所有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catalogue everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.64,0:41:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.63,0:41:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿应该是献祭墓室的正下方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This should be directly below the sacrificial chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.96,0:42:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞巴斯提安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sebastian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.36,0:42:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一具石棺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a sarcophagus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.80,0:42:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是玛雅人长历法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Long Count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.26,0:42:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是阿芝台克人的日历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Aztec calendar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.82,0:42:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个 是种密码锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this...it's some kind of combination lock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.59,0:42:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“日”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.52,0:42:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“月”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.48,0:42:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“年”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.59,0:42:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,历盘被设置在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dials are set for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.67,0:42:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1904年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1904.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.00,0:42:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人在100年前开启过?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone opened this 100 years ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.35,0:42:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 今天几号? - 十月十日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's today's date? - October 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.31,0:42:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2004年10月10日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10/10/2004.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.45,0:42:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你确信会起作用? - 不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure this is gonna work? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.39,0:43:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.39,0:43:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.51,0:43:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.18,0:44:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any idea what these are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.10,0:44:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.52,0:44:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.20,0:44:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.06,0:44:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们带了专家来 是件好事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good thing we brought the experts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.27,0:44:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 不错 是件好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yeah. It is a good thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.36,0:44:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这就像发现了摩西的DVD收藏品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cos this is like finding Moses' DVD collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.56,0:44:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.99,0:44:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点太兴奋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little too much excitement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.39,0:44:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们在外面呆得足够久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been out long enough for today. We'll set up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.87,0:44:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要回捕鲸站去扎营 明天一大早再过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}base camp at the whaling station and get back at it tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.31,0:44:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 伍兹小姐 你可以回营地去 但我们要留在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you can go back to the base camp, Ms Woods, but we're staying here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.46,0:44:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.98,0:44:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有作必要的准备 你就要求动身 我们照做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to leave without proper prep. We did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.21,0:44:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想作到这儿的第一批人 我们现在已经是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to be the first here. We are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.90,0:44:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经宣告了这些发现 都是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've claimed the find. It's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.90,0:44:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直统一行动 这些天我们必须做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we move as a team, and we're done for the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.30,0:45:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到她说的话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.28,0:45:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想如何处置这些?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you wanna do with these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.85,0:45:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.18,0:45:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到地面上还要进一步测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll run further tests on the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.37,0:45:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.91,0:45:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.67,0:45:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.94,0:45:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.86,0:45:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.23,0:45:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事儿吧? - 没事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You OK? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.59,0:45:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,石板大概有两吨重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slab's gotta weigh two tons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.07,0:45:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没办法弄开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll never move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.08,0:46:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说这间房间叫什么来着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say this room was called?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.93,0:46:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,献祭墓室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sacrificial chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.96,0:47:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听的见么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.20,0:47:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 卢梭 - 托米 进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rousseau. - Tommy, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.00,0:47:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于这个地方的信息 你有什么没告诉我的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything you didn't tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.85,0:47:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.68,0:47:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的猜测和你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your guess is as good as mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.27,0:47:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论这儿是什么 我们都没做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, we're not prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.59,0:47:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们集合剩余的队员回地表去 行动吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna round up the rest of the team and get to the surface. Let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.09,0:47:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.53,0:47:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始我的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.47,0:47:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的职责到此为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yours is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.66,0:47:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人安然无恙的返回轮船 我的工作才算完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My job is over when everyone is back on the boat safely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.07,0:47:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,枪是改变不了什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that gun doesn't change anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.32,0:47:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个方向应该可以到达入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bearing should take us back to the entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.88,0:47:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要在捕鲸站重新组队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll regroup at the whaling station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.15,0:47:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托马斯怎么办?还有卢梭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Thomas? Rousseau?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.02,0:47:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到上面再搜寻他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find them on the way up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.58,0:47:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马克思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.58,0:47:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯通 弗海顿 殿后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stone, Verheiden. Cover our backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.22,0:47:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你卫星发现的热量激增现象 现在变得有意义了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heat bloom your satellite detected makes more sense now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.71,0:47:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.90,0:48:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这座精妙的建筑物需要一个能量源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A building this sophisticated requires an energy source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.57,0:48:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得那才应是你卫星发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's what your satellite detected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.43,0:48:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这座金字塔的能源系统开始运作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A power plant for this pyramid firing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.35,0:48:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始准备了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preparing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.58,0:48:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备?准备什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preparing? For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.99,0:48:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.70,0:49:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.44,0:49:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 认得他们肩部的东西吗? - 认得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Recognise what's on their shoulders? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.32,0:50:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们崇拜这些东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We worshipped these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.38,0:50:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据此来讲 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to this, we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.72,0:50:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们从石棺里移走的古器物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the artefacts you removed from the sarcophagus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.10,0:50:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概就是他们的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seem to be their weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.96,0:50:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.96,0:50:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离入口只有200码了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only another 200 yards to the entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.92,0:50:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.84,0:50:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.08,0:50:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯通哪儿去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.86,0:50:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.62,0:51:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金字塔又开始移动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pyramid's shifting again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.76,0:51:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门快关上了 快出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doors are closing. Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.52,0:51:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.80,0:51:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.25,0:51:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.11,0:51:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.40,0:51:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 弗海顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Verheiden!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.03,0:51:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.11,0:51:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑 走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.34,0:52:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打中了那个杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hit that son of a bitch dead on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.39,0:52:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们停下来了么? 它们慢下来了么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't stop, It didn't slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.40,0:52:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 弗海顿 - 它们走了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Verheiden. - It didn't even flinch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.26,0:52:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 弗海顿 - 干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Verheiden. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.75,0:52:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是一个战士 但是我认为你真的需要冷静一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a soldier but I think you should calm down, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.69,0:52:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没有死 知道么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not dead yet, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.77,0:52:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好 谢谢了 教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thanks, professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.94,0:52:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是“博士”… 还有 谢谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually it's 'doctor'... and you're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.22,0:52:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.82,0:52:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 能听见吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.79,0:52:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是康纳斯 你们在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Connors! Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.73,0:53:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're never getting out of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.10,0:53:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有孩子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you got any children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.15,0:53:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.22,0:53:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一样 我有两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I've got two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.65,0:53:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说我们不能放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means that we do not have the luxury of quitting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.16,0:53:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna make it outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.77,0:53:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要活着 即使一路上我得背着你走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're surviving this if I have to carry you the whole way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.87,0:54:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后面无路可走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way out back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.16,0:54:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有损坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.00,0:54:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们死了一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of our men is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.83,0:54:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要知道他是怎么死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know what this man died for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.05,0:54:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了试图创造历史而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died trying to make history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.73,0:54:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁的历史?你的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose... yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.74,0:54:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.17,0:54:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,推测而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.25,0:54:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿芝台克人的历法是公制的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Aztec calendar was metric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.62,0:54:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,基于十进制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Based on multiples of ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.06,0:55:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这座金字塔每十分钟会变换一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm guessing the pyramid reconfigures every ten minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.61,0:55:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们靠在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.40,0:55:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.15,0:55:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就像迷宫里的老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would seem that we are rats in a maze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.06,0:55:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.45,0:56:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,康纳斯?康纳斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connors? Connors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.74,0:56:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弗海顿?弗海顿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Verheiden? Verheiden?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.32,0:56:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 噢 上帝 - 米勒博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, God. - Dr Miller!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.44,0:56:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.95,0:56:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧 我找路下去 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK. I'm gonna find a way to get down to you. OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.19,0:56:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弗海顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Verheiden!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.32,0:57:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.03,0:57:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想吃我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a piece of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.52,0:57:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个婊子养的丑种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ugly son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.42,0:57:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.84,0:58:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.68,0:58:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰 他们只会妨碍我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it. They can only slow us down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.16,0:58:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空手而归的话 代价就太大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too much has been lost to leave here with nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.50,0:58:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.15,0:58:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马克思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.43,0:58:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.83,0:58:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.73,1:00:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来 我们必须找到韦兰德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We have to get Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.16,1:00:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.94,1:03:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were those things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.93,1:03:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉我 你是专家啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell me, you're the pyramid expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.84,1:03:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要歇一下 我要歇一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to stop. I've got to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.57,1:03:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放松 韦兰德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy. Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.57,1:03:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland, look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.86,1:03:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.20,1:03:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须放慢呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to slow your breathing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.90,1:03:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢来 稳住呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow, steady breaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.93,1:03:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.82,1:03:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我站不起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hardly stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.16,1:03:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想你死在这下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna let you die down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.66,1:03:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会这样想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.39,1:03:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又来了一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.71,1:03:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们快走 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.76,1:03:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 韦兰德 - 跟我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Weyland. - Come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.18,1:03:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 带她离开这儿 - 韦兰德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get her outta here. - Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.60,1:03:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快 - 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now! - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.20,1:03:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.35,1:04:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别背对着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't turn your back on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.32,1:04:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 - 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. - This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.48,1:04:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦兰德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.02,1:05:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对付不了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't hold them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.56,1:05:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得立刻跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.09,1:05:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起带着它去地面上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We keep it together, we make it to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.84,1:05:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.25,1:05:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起带着它去地面上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We keep it together, we make it to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.33,1:05:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起带着它去地面上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We keep it together, we make it to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.66,1:05:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带着它去地面上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we make it to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.85,1:05:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带着它去地面上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make it to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.87,1:05:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 - 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. - This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.35,1:05:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.89,1:07:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往这儿看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.90,1:07:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在身上作记号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's marking himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.77,1:07:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.26,1:07:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,古代的勇士会用他们捕杀的猎物的血来标志自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ancient warriors would mark themselves with the blood of their kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.08,1:07:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是种仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a rite of passage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.64,1:07:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is starting to make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.17,1:08:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为这是一个成人仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this is a manhood ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.03,1:08:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们被送来这里 证明自己有能力成为成人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been sent here to prove that they are worthy to become adults.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.58,1:08:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说他们是什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying they're what...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.93,1:08:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少年?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}teenagers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.52,1:08:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么他们一开始没有携带那些枪炮的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why they didn't carry those guns with them to begin with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.59,1:08:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们必须去获得武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have to earn them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.46,1:08:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些象形文字解读起来有点困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hieroglyphs are a little difficult to make out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.13,1:08:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但故事都记载于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the story is all here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.87,1:08:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几千年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thousands of years ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.70,1:08:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些猎人发现了这颗文明停滞不前的行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these hunters found a backwater planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.46,1:09:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们教人类如何建造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They taught humans how to build{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.82,1:09:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因此被奉为神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and were worshipped as gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.62,1:09:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每隔百年 神会返回一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every hundred years the gods would return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.16,1:09:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,返回的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when they did,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.48,1:09:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们期待一次献祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they would expect a sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.29,1:09:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类被用于繁殖这类终极掠食者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans were used to breed the ultimate prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.61,1:09:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎人们和这些巨蛇作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hunters would battle with these great serpents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.88,1:09:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以此证明他们配带此标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to prove themselves worthy to carry the mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.75,1:10:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果猎人输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if the hunters lost,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.26,1:10:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会让一切灰飞烟灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they made sure nothing survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.68,1:10:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整个文明一夜之间消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An entire civilisation wiped out overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.35,1:10:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来… 具有人类特质的猎人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... the humanoids, the hunters...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.82,1:10:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们 派这些生物到此 是为了狩猎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They brought those creatures here to hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.07,1:10:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把我们当成牲畜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they use us like cattle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.07,1:10:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是他们繁衍的宿主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're hosts for them to breed in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.23,1:10:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热量激增便是引诱我们来此的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heat bloom was the sign to lure us down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.75,1:10:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整个就是一个圈套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole thing was a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.40,1:10:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.47,1:10:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能就无法狩猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there could be no hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.74,1:11:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弗海顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Verheiden!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.44,1:11:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.88,1:12:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那扇门开的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When that door opens,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.42,1:12:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就会死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.36,1:12:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们改变了状况 就不会死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if we set things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.30,1:12:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.36,1:12:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这座金字塔就像是监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This pyramid is like a prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.64,1:12:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿走了卫兵的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took the guards' guns,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.09,1:12:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以囚犯就肆意妄为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now the prisoners are running free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.56,1:12:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要重建秩序 卫兵就必须要得到他们的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To restore order, the guards need their guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.66,1:12:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门开的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When that door opens,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.59,1:12:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就把他的枪放回原位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna give that thing his gun back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.68,1:12:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.91,1:12:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狩猎时 被猎杀的动物绝不会为猎人装配武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}During a big-game hunt, the animals being hunted don't arm the hunters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.49,1:12:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是来猎杀我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not hunting us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.35,1:12:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们介乎战争双方之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the middle of a war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.22,1:12:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这时候应该选择依靠一方 - 我们自己是一方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's time to pick a side. - We are on our side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.05,1:12:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须考虑一下无法活着出去的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to consider the possibility that we might not make it out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.02,1:12:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们也要确保那些巨蛇不会到达地表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have to make sure those serpents don't reach the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.17,1:12:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为一旦他们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if they do,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.08,1:12:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万事万物将不复存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything everywhere could die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.60,1:13:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敌人的敌人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The enemy of my enemy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.81,1:13:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.79,1:13:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找我们的朋友吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go find our friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.24,1:13:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意大利语“极度恐惧”怎么讲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you say "scared shitless" in Italian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.19,1:13:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More or less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.28,1:19:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你一起 听到了吗?你个丑陋的怪物?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming with you. You hear me, you ugly creature?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.40,1:20:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.98,1:25:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是颗炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.06,1:25:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 真希望能把这该死的东西都炸死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hope it kills every fucking one of 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.33,1:26:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个丑陋的母亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are one ugly mother...{\r}
